      Announcing the Wireless Battle Mesh v4
   (16-20 March 2011, Sant Bartomeu del Grau, Spain)
=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=
